  - title: LEVEL 26 | Exact Ten Wire Connections
    explanation: 'CONNECT 10 EXTERNAL WIRES: (1) Battery_positive -> SwitchInput;
      (2) SwitchOutput -> D_BRIDGE_1_Anode; (3) SwitchOutput -> D_BRIDGE_3_Cathode;
      (4) Battery_negative -> D_BRIDGE_2_Anode; (5) Battery_negative -> D_BRIDGE_4_Cathode;
      (6) D_BRIDGE_1_Cathode -> R_LIMIT_Input; (7) D_BRIDGE_2_Cathode -> R_LIMIT_Input;
      (8) R_LIMIT_Output -> LED_Anode; (9) LED_Cathode -> D_BRIDGE_3_Anode; (10)
      LED_Cathode -> D_BRIDGE_4_Anode. Wire terminal to terminal; do not confuse
      diode orientation with drawing position.'
    caption: PAGE 2/4 | WIRE NODES A, B, P, N | SHARED JUNCTIONS
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
