  - title: LEVEL 26 | Correct Solution and Six Targets
    explanation: 'DESIGN ESTIMATES, NOT MEASURED: 5 V supply; approximately 0.7 V
      across each conducting diode D1 and D4; about 2.0 V across green LED; about
      1.6 V across 220 Ohm resistor; current about 7.3 mA. Targets: supply 4.8-5.2
      V, D1 drop 0.45-1 V, D4 drop 0.45-1 V, LED ON, resistor current 6-9 mA, resistor
      drop 1.3-1.9 V. Declare runtime IDs D_BRIDGE_1 through D_BRIDGE_4 and R_LIMIT;
      fixed LED IDs remain led, LED_Anode, LED_Cathode. Only the level evaluator
      awards 6/6.'
    caption: PAGE 4/4 | 5 V | D1/D4 0.45-1 V | LED ON | 6-9 mA
